{"id":"435cb47051c1ff62","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence.md","title":"输出机等价须计入初始输出","display":"thm-moore-mealy-equivalence — 输出机等价须计入初始输出","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence"],"display":"thm-moore-mealy-equivalence — 输出机等价须计入初始输出","depends_on":["[[73-df-moore-mealy-machines]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"Theorems 2.6–2.7, p. 44; scan 52","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorems 2.6–2.7, p. 44; scan 52","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-moore-mealy-equivalence — 输出机等价须计入初始输出"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"edb8fdcf98898b8c\" href=\"?note=edb8fdcf98898b8c\" title=\"73-df-moore-mealy-machines\">73-df-moore-mealy-machines</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Theorems 2.6–2.7, p. 44; scan 52"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorems 2.6–2.7, p. 44; scan 52"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Delta\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Delta\\)</span> 为字母表。Moore/Mealy 结构与输出函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"edb8fdcf98898b8c\" href=\"?note=edb8fdcf98898b8c\" title=\"73-df-moore-mealy-machines\">73-df-moore-mealy-machines</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 分别在各个存在式中取相应类型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\Delta\">\\(b\\in\\Delta\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\;(\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\exists N\\;\\exists b\\in\\Delta\\;[\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\;(\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\exists N\\;\\exists b\\in\\Delta\\;[\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\;(\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\Longrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\Delta\\;\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\;(\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\Longrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\Delta\\;\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>Moore 到 Mealy 时用 λ′(q,a)=λ(δ(q,a))。反向用状态 Q×Δ、初态 (q₀,b)、转移 (q,c)↦(δ(q,a),λ(q,a))、状态输出 c。按词长归纳证明等式。不能直接写两种完整输出函数相等，因为空词的输出已经不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-moore-mealy-machines","status":"resolved","id":"edb8fdcf98898b8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-moore-mealy-machines]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-moore-mealy-machines","status":"resolved","id":"edb8fdcf98898b8c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma,\\Delta$ 为字母表。Moore/Mealy 结构与输出函数见 [[73-df-moore-mealy-machines]]。$M$、$N$ 分别在各个存在式中取相应类型，$b\\in\\Delta$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall M\\;(\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\Longrightarrow\\exists N\\;\\exists b\\in\\Delta\\;[\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}moore\\text{-}mealy\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall N\\;(\\operatorname{Mealy}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(N)\\Longrightarrow\\forall b\\in\\Delta\\;\\exists M\\;[\\operatorname{Moore}_{\\Sigma,\\Delta}(M)\\land\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;T^{\\mathsf{Mo}}_M(w)=\\langle b\\rangle T^{\\mathsf{Me}}_N(w)])","display":true}],"bytes":2108,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-moore-mealy-equivalence|输出机等价须计入初始输出]]"}],"outgoing":["edb8fdcf98898b8c"]}